Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Hyder</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name><name><surname>Pielemeier</surname><given-names>NR</given-names></name><name><surname>Mills</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Evans</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Overcoming health-systems constraints to achieve the Millennium Development Goals</article-title><source>The Lancet</source><year>2004</year><volume>364</volume><fpage>900</fpage><lpage>906</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(04)16987-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ntoburi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Wagai</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Irimu</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>English</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Debating the quality and performance of health systems at a global level is not enough, national debates are essential for progress*</article-title><source>Tropical Medicine &#x00026; International Health</source><year>2008</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>444</fpage><lpage>447</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18346030</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>UNICEF/WHO</collab></person-group><article-title>Pneumonia the forgotten killer of children UNICEF/HQ05-0531</article-title><year>2006</year><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.unicef.org/publications/files/Pneumonia_The_Forgotten_Killer_of_Children.pdf"/></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kallander</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Hildenwall</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Waiswa</surname><given-names>P</given-names></